      DependencyIndex: 58
      LevelID: 22
      NodeType: 3
      Ports:
        Description:
          String: ""
        DescriptionText:
          ClassType1: TEXT
          String: |-
            Cheap way of doing reflection and it’s not actually reflecting the scene it’s just using whatever is in that sampling texture. The reflection lookup technically assumes a spherical environment map,  which is a circular shaped texture.
            
            Inputs:
            Reflection Texture - The Texture 2D Object Map use a reflection map.
            Intensity - The strength of the reflection effect.
            X Rotation of the Texture - X-axis rotation simple reflection texture,  wrap mode U repeat required.
            Y Rotation of the Texture - Y-axis rotation simple reflection texture,  wrap mode V repeat required.
            Normal Map - Texture 2D Normal Map input.
        FirstTime:
          Variable: false
        Locked:
          Variable: false
        SubGraphUniqueID224:
          Connection0:
            NodeLevelID: 25
            PortID: Output
